@startuml Caregiver Context Switching & Delegation
skinparam actorStyle AWESOME
autonumber

actor "User (Caregiver)" as U1
participant "Application" as App
participant "Backend" as BE
database "Caregiver Consent Database" as DB
database "FHIR" as FHIR
participant "Audit Log Cache" as Audit

== Phase 1: Context Switching ==
U1 -> App: Selects Dependent (Patient) from "Managed Dependents"
note left of App: activePatientId handled through state management
App -> App: Set activePatientId = Patient_ID
App -> App: Switch UI to "Caregiver View"

== Phase 2: Authorized Request ==
U1 -> App: View Patient's Records
App -> BE: GET /clinical/observations
note right: Header: Subject-Patient-ID = Patient_ID\nAuthorization: Bearer <User_JWT>

BE -> BE: extract User_ID from JWT
BE -> BE: extract Patient_ID from Header

BE -> DB: Is there an active 'caregiver' grant?
DB -> BE: Return Grant

alt Authorized
    BE -> FHIR: GET /<patient_data_API>?patient=Patient_ID
    FHIR -> BE: Return Data
    BE -> App: 200 OK (Data for Patient)
    BE -> Audit: Log ACCESS_ALLOWED 
else Unauthorized
    BE -> App: 403 Forbidden
    BE -> Audit: Log ACCESS_DENIED 
end

== Phase 3: Switching Back ==
U1 -> App: Tap "Return to my Profile"
App -> App: Clear activePatientId
App -> App: Reset UI to "Patient View"
@enduml